---
layout: default
---
<div class="home-page">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Experimental mechanician · PhD candidate</p>
      <h1 id="home-title">Experimental mechanics and model validation.</h1>
      <p class="home-hero__intro">
        I combine solid mechanics, full-field experiments, and finite element simulation to characterize material behavior and validate predictive
        models—using machine learning where it improves resolution, inference, or speed.
      </p>
      <p class="home-hero__meta">
        PhD Candidate in Engineering Mechanics at
        <a href="https://www.utexas.edu/">The University of Texas at Austin</a> · Graduating 2027
      </p>
      <div class="home-hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">Explore my research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="{{ '/assets/pdf/Zixiang_Tong_Resume.pdf' | relative_url }}">Download résumé</a>
      </div>
      <div class="availability"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Open to 2027 research engineering opportunities</div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-hero__portrait">
      <div class="portrait-frame">
        <img
          src="{{ '/assets/img/portrait.jpg' | relative_url }}"
          alt="Portrait of Zixiang Tong"
          width="1000"
          height="1000"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
      </div>
      <p class="portrait-caption">Austin, Texas</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">What I do</p>
      <h2 id="capabilities-title">Measure. Model. Validate.</h2>
      <p>
        I work across the full mechanics loop—from loading a specimen to measuring its response, identifying its properties, and testing the model.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability-grid">
      <article class="capability-card">
        <span class="capability-card__index">01</span>
        <h3>Measure</h3>
        <p>Observe material response under real loading with quantitative, full-field experiments.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>DIC &amp; DVC</li>
          <li>High-speed imaging</li>
          <li>Instrumented testing</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="capability-card">
        <span class="capability-card__index">02</span>
        <h3>Model</h3>
        <p>Represent deformation, stress, interfaces, and rate effects with physics-based models.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Solid &amp; continuum mechanics</li>
          <li>Finite element analysis</li>
          <li>Thermo-mechanical systems</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="capability-card">
        <span class="capability-card__index">03</span>
        <h3>Identify &amp; validate</h3>
        <p>Use measured fields to recover material properties and quantify whether a simulation predicts reality.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Inverse identification</li>
          <li>Simulation–test correlation</li>
          <li>Learning-accelerated models</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="featured-work-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected research</p>
        <h2 id="featured-work-title">Mechanics questions, answered with experiments and computation.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">Explore all research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="featured-work-grid">
      {% assign featured_projects = site.projects | where: 'featured', true | sort: 'importance' %}
      {% for project in featured_projects limit: 3 %}
        {% include projects.liquid project=project featured=true %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-publications" aria-labelledby="selected-research-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected research</p>
        <h2 id="selected-research-title">Mechanics, measurement, and model validation.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/publications/' | relative_url }}">All publications <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    {% include selected_papers.liquid %}
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-updates" aria-labelledby="updates-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
        <h2 id="updates-title">Latest updates.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}">Full timeline <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    {% include news.liquid limit=true %}
  </section>

  <section class="home-contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="home-contact__heading">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Contact</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="home-contact__details">
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.data.socials.email }}">{{ site.data.socials.email }}</a><br>
        Engineering Mechanics, The University of Texas at Austin<br>
        Austin, Texas
      </p>
      <nav class="home-contact__links" aria-label="Contact and professional profiles">
        <a href="https://github.com/{{ site.data.socials.github_username }}">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/{{ site.data.socials.linkedin_username }}">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user={{ site.data.socials.scholar_userid }}">Google Scholar</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
